# oracle: the pressure of pair brownian with newton off (w231co_brownian_newtonoff with press and its components): native Verlet tallies the virial pair by pair with newton off (half per owned atom of a pair), not as x.f
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 4.8e-14, atoms 0.0e+0. Before the fix the engine printed press 127.8 at step 0 where native prints -21.3.
# native: installed lmp (b332f28)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           lj
newton          off
atom_style      sphere
boundary        p p p
region          box block 0 12 0 12 0 12
create_box      1 box
lattice         sc 0.1
create_atoms    1 box
set             type 1 diameter 2.0
set             type 1 density 1.0
pair_style      brownian 1.5 1 1 2.01 2.5 2.0 5878567
pair_coeff      * *
fix             1 all nve/sphere
compute         rot all erotate/sphere
thermo_style    custom step pe ke c_rot press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
timestep        0.0001
thermo          10
run             30
